{"id":"vod_sn_35613","vodId":"35613","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士铠武","name_cn":"假面骑士铠武","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/aa11b6303620e0addb64ecac50b7e9ef.jpg"},"summary":"铠武活跃的舞台是在一个新兴都市。以巨大企业为核心，经济十分繁荣，然而却有种闭塞的感觉，于是年轻人通过跳街舞驱散沉闷的气氛。在这些年轻人中间，暗地里流行着一种通过lock seed召唤小动物Invase，并让它们互相战斗的游戏。这些小动物Invase在游戏进行中会从打开的“异世界之门”现身，然而通往“异世界”的门却开始在世界各地开启，招来了威胁人类的危机。　　从异世界出现的怪物究竟是？它们的目的是？　　假面骑士铠武将如何拯救全人类的危机？他的对手骑士的命运会是？在混沌的现代社会，为贯彻信念而战，简直就是假面骑士的战国时代！用鲜艳的水果lock seed变身，厚重感满溢的骑士战斗要开始了!","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":47,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/mJG0WamqXu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/dBwQ7YseRp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/pXT5VnHRvq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/eKquDRRc9B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/RMx9MJDTkq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/LYFzt6t9Zh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/TchetUpAyY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/pxfejGgppy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/sgYAPDnirb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/YrnpE8WgEA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/ct5bmYnxf51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/QjdEtYYSni1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/997wTChwLt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/y2hBZDeaTw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"